<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 13.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsara (built 1978) 72,200 dwt del NoPac t/c redel Genoa $5,200 daily plus $120,000 bonus Deiulemar (ammended).</p>
<p>Anangel Power (built 1982) 34,070 del Cont 15-20/11 redel Vancouver $10,500 daily Star (ammended).</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
